   7: (C) 오라클 CI: 46_review_fixes.py의 구버전(미재척도) 군집 부트스트랩으로 산출돼 있었음 → Rao-Wu 재척도로 재산출
   8: 
   9: 출력: results/review3_metrics.csv, review3_fairness_domain.csv, review3_oracle_ci.csv
  10: """
  11: import sys, warnings, numpy as np, pandas as pd
  12: sys.stdout.reconfigure(encoding="utf-8"); warnings.filterwarnings("ignore")
  13: from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split, StratifiedKFold
  14: from sklearn.compose import ColumnTransformer
